# Fabrication Foundry: "Exile one or more other artifacts you control with total mana value X" and "target artifact card with mana value X or
# less" (CR 107.3a, 202.3, 601.2b-c, 602.2b). Bot1 builds the Foundry (2), Sol Ring (1), Fellwar Stone (2) and three Moxen on turn 1; on turn
# 2 Bot2 casts a Mana Vault (1) and Shatters Bot1's Fellwar Stone and Mox Pearl, so that Bot1's graveyard holds a card with mana value 2 and one
# with mana value 0.
# X = 1 is announced: the Fellwar Stone (2) is one past the limit and no target, the Mox Pearl (0) is one. The cost takes the Sol Ring (1) and
# the Mox Ruby (0) together, two artifacts with total mana value 1; Bot2's Mana Vault (also 1) is not one Bot1 controls. The ability, sorcery speed, is not offered while a Mox
# Emerald is on the stack and is once it has resolved; the Sol Ring's mana and a Plains pay {2}{W} exactly.

